UID:10006681-1785715200-1785801599@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:Summer Art Camp | Landscapes: Real\, Remembered\, and Reimagined (Rising 6th – 8th grade)
DESCRIPTION:REGISTER HERE \nStudents will explore landscape art through drawing\, painting\, and mixed media. Using the museum’s exhibitions as inspiration\, students will study space\, color\, light\, and composition. Projects move from observational landscapes to personal and expressive interpretations of place\, encouraging both technical skill and creative voice.  \nMeet the Instructor: SJ Booze\nSJ Booze is an art educator with a background in oil painting\, screen printing\, photography\, and videography. She enjoys exploring and experimenting freely with a wide variety of artistic mediums alongside her students. 
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/summer-art-camp-landscapes-real-remembered-and-reimagined-rising-6th-8th-grade-3/
CATEGORIES:Summer Art Camp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/2021.35.01.jpg
END:VEVENT
