SUMMARY:Art Break | The Art of Paper with co-curator Cynthia Thompson
DESCRIPTION:Cynthia Nourse Thompson is currently Professor and Director of Curatorial Affairs at the Zuckerman Museum of Art at Kennesaw State University. Prior to this position\, for six years she was Associate Professor and Director of the graduate programs in Book Arts & Printmaking and Studio Art at University of the Arts in Philadelphia\, PA\, while also serving as curator for the Joy Pratt Markham Gallery at the Walton Arts Center in Fayetteville\, AR. As a curator\, Thompson has organized and curated more than 50 exhibitions since 2000. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/art-break-the-art-of-paper-with-co-curator-cynthia-thompson/
