SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds | Willie Sime
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a live performance by local pianist Willie Sime. \nWillie Sime is a North Carolina Native who began playing the piano from a very young age.  He was heavily influenced by his father who was a jazz pianist and shared the stage with jazz and rock legends such as; Miles Davis\, Thelonious Monk and The Grateful Dead.  Willie is a dedicated composer and improv artist with jazz\, classical and minimalist influence. \n\n\nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/sunday-sounds-willie-sime/
