DESCRIPTION:Every Third Thursday\, the Museum comes alive with an evening filled with music\, tours\, art making\, special cocktails in our rooftop café\, and more! \nThis month we are featuring Book + Art |The Loneliest Monk\, with poet Richard Chess and artist Tobi Kahn from 6-7:30pm. \nEnjoy an evening of live music with DJ Phantom Pantone on the Museum’s rooftop overlooking Mount Pisgah • Perspective Café and Sculpture Terrace\, level 4 \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
